    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Over a hundred members of civil society participated in a golf tournament in Karachi on Sunday to support the Aga Khan University's efforts to expand access to surgeries and procedures for children born with congenital heart defects, CHD, commonly known as 'holes in the heart'.",
